      164.85,
      226.37,
      398.85,
      249.59
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE TOWN AND COUNTRY PLANNING ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 269)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      261.77,
      401.9,
      284.99
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      297.17,
      401.86,
      320.39
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Town and CountryPlanning (Amendment) Act, No. of 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      332.57,
      401.9,
      379.31
    ],
    "text": "2.The Long Title to the Town and Country PlanningOrdinance (Chapter 269) (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby repealed and thefollowing Long Title substituted therefor:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      391.61,
      401.91,
      520.91
    ],
    "text": "\u201cAn Act to provide for the formulation andimplementation of a National Physical PlanningPolicy with the objectives of promoting, preserving,conserving and regulating a system of integratedplanning in relation to the economic, social, historic,environmental, physical and religious aspects of landin Sri Lanka; for the preparation of a national physicalplan for the purpose of giving effect to the statedobjectives; to facilitate the acquisition of land for thepurpose of giving effect to the objectives; and to providefor matters connected therewith or incidental thereto.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      533.21,
      401.88,
      579.95
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 2 of the Town and Country PlanningOrdinance (Chapter 269) (hereinafter referred to as \u201ctheprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby repealed and the followingsection substituted therefor:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      592.13,
      401.88,
      674.51
    ],
    "text": "2. (1) The National Physical Councilestablished under section 3 of this Act shalltake steps under this Ordinance to prepare aNational Physical Policy and a NationalPhysical Plan which shall embody the saidPolicy in order to give effect to the objectivesto the Act as set out below.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      144.57,
      533.35,
      452.86,
      673.31
    ],
    "text": "Replacementof section 2of the Townand CountryPlanningOrdinance(Chapter269).\u201cPreparationof theNationalPhysical Planand its scopeandobjectives ofthe Act.30",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      167.17,
      363.32,
      178.24
    ],
    "text": "Town and Country Planning (Amendment)2",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      146.71,
      253.49,
      151.71,
      264.83
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      314.45,
      150.31,
      325.79
    ],
    "text": "10",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      422.93,
      150.31,
      434.27
    ],
    "text": "15",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      511.49,
      150.31,
      522.83
    ],
    "text": "20",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      203.09,
      397.18,
      337.43
    ],
    "text": "(2) The objectives of this Act shall be topromote, preserve, conserve and regulate asystem of integrated planning anddevelopment for securing proper infrastructure,amenities and conveniences in relation to theeconomic, social, historic, environmental,physical and religious aspects of land in SriLanka (whether or not there are buildingstherein), and for such purpose, there may bedeclared in accordance with the succeedingprovisions of this Act\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      230.95,
      350.69,
      329.6,
      362.03
    ],
    "text": "(a)\u201cProtection Areas\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      230.95,
      375.29,
      342.44,
      386.63
    ],
    "text": "(b)\u201cConservation Areas\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      231.67,
      399.89,
      397.17,
      411.23
    ],
    "text": "(c)\u201cArchitectural\u201d or \u201cHistoric Areas\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      230.95,
      424.49,
      313.88,
      435.83
    ],
    "text": "(d)\u201cSacred Areas\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      449.09,
      397.18,
      472.79
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 6 of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed and the following section is substituted therefor:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      486.05,
      397.21,
      558.83
    ],
    "text": "6. The Minister may, within any municipalarea, an urban development area or within anytrunk road development area, by Orderpublished in the Gazette declare, for givingeffect to the objectives of the Ordinance, anyarea of defined land, to be \u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      230.95,
      572.09,
      397.17,
      595.79
    ],
    "text": "(a)a \u201cProtection Area\u201d for the protectionof natural amenities;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      230.95,
      609.05,
      397.18,
      669.59
    ],
    "text": "(b)a \u201cConservation Area\u201d for theconservation of the naturalenvironment and the protection ofplaces of natural beauty within theenvironment; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      450.67,
      448.16,
      601.82
    ],
    "text": "Replacementof section 6of theprincipalenactment.\u201cDeclarationof\u201cProtectionareas\u201d,ConservationAreas\u201d,\u201cArchitectural\u201dor \u201cHistoricAreas\u201d, forthe purposesof theOrdinance.25",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      656.93,
      150.31,
      668.27
    ],
    "text": "30",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      195.57,
      167.17,
      402.89,
      178.24
    ],
    "text": "3Town and Country Planning (Amendment)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      236.37,
      202.61,
      401.88,
      236.99
    ],
    "text": "(c)an \u201cArchitectural\u201d or \u201cHistoric Area\u201dfor the conservation of building ofarchitectural and historic value\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      247.13,
      401.92,
      292.91
    ],
    "text": "5.The following new sections are hereby insertedimmediately after section 6 of the principal enactment andshall have effect as section 6A and section 6B of thatenactment:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      302.09,
      401.88,
      428.39
    ],
    "text": "6A.The Minister to whom the subject ofBuddha Sasana and Religious Affairs isassigned, shall after, notifying the Minister towhom the subject of Physical Planning has beenassigned, within any urban development area,within any trunk road development area ofany regional development area. by Orderpublished in the Gazette declare for thepurposes of the Ordinance, any area of definedland, to be a \u201cSacred Area\u201d for the purpose ofprotection and conservation of such area.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
